            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3 id="bugfixes">Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>修复 vscode 数字开头时使用一级简码会产生多余空格的问题 fix <a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/issues/200">#200</a> (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/77f836da4b11d813efb0a99d2b02defb35a68713">77f836d</a>)</li>
<li>修复在 firefox 等应用下，成对符号配对输出时，光标不会移动到成对符号中间的问题。fix <a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/issues/198">#198</a> (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/c313c7b73c8ed76084c1c678a81c50697fc4895a">c313c7b</a>)</li>
<li>修复在屏幕边缘时，切换选中候选词时窗口闪烁的问题 (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/9acc0d123cc1bcde47b5e0c659ee6c46372bb6ea">9acc0d1</a>)</li>
<li>修复首次安装无法启用输入法的问题 (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/ff8c1bfb155c6d2cec451fd930a425db873105b5">ff8c1bf</a>)</li>
<li>候选词上屏时走 commitCandidate，恢复统计记录 (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/c38e7fb77ea3bab99981bc125d79e706849131e0">c38e7fb</a>)</li>
<li>尝试修复首次安装问题 (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/ff7c3a034a11047325b735390325dc1e96ddc485">ff7c3a0</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="features">Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>候选词过长时自动换行 (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/834284812fcd5a54f66c279d49f7eddde55d008f">8342848</a>)</li>
<li>禁用中英文切换与切换中英文快捷键配置合并；修复修改切换中英文快捷键需要重启生效的问题 <a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/issues/204">#204</a> (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/ea281eabf98c73bd8f9a390d8a6b251b176f2bdd">ea281ea</a>)</li>
</ul>
